From 0a7b179a01118e6a2962762e4c823a5e60e0b2a0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Duron27 <duron27@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 01:54:18 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Stage 3 (redo): per-player worlds with groups and marked
 proxy actors

- drop world-mutating sync (doors/pickups/drops/time); each player keeps their own world
- relay: group routing, targeted messages, late-join replay, reset/leave on group change
- proxies.lua: roster of living actors; proxies of group members' actors that are dead/missing locally,
  named '[Owner's world]', own record without script, damage forwarded to the owner's real actor
- damage.lua/remote.lua: damage application, health mirroring, kill notice
- settings group (host/port/group) in Options -> Scripts -> Multiplayer
- owner_bot.py to test with a single client

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
